  "body": "Don't settle for a standard layout when you can have a home that effortlessly adapts to your lifestyle. Designed for the ultimate work-from-home space, or simply enjoy a flexible layout, this property delivers on every front.\r\n\r\nThe Ground Floor Advantage\r\n* What truly sets this home apart is its incredibly versatile ground-floor studio. Complete with its own bathroom and benefiting from the home's dual entrances, this space offers ultimate convenience and privacy. It is the perfect setup for a teenager's retreat, separate living or a private home office.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor Living\r\n* The heart of the home is on the first floor, featuring a spacious living area that boasts the home's second street access. Designed with indoor-outdoor flow in mind, the lounge opens opens right up onto a paved patio, creating a seamless extension of your living space. Entertaining is a breeze in the generously proportioned kitchen, offering endless counter space and storage.\r\n\r\nA Lifestyle, Not Just a Home\r\n* Living at Melia Place means expanding your living space far beyond your front door. As a resident, you'll enjoy exclusive access to premium community amenities designed to make every day feel like a holiday.\r\n\r\n* Host gatherings or meet the neighbors in the community club room.\r\n\r\n* Enjoy a morning walk or let the kids run free in the private park.\r\n\r\n* Stay active and get your game on at the community courts.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights at a Glance:\r\n\r\n3 Bedrooms + 1 Studio\r\n\r\n3 Bathrooms (Including a highly convenient ground-floor bathroom)\r\n\r\n2 Separate Entrances for ultimate privacy and flexibility\r\n\r\nExclusive Community Perks: Club room, park, and sports courts\r\n\r\nDon't settle for a standard layout when you can have a home that adapts to your lifestyle. Properties with this level of flexibility and community amenity are rare.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing and secure your spot in this fantastic community!",
